#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Here, the wheel-end kinematics are replaced. This extends the C-Class Hatchback behavior, to illustrate methods for adding detail to the kinematic description.
#
#When replacing only the tie rod / steer arm behavior, all of the steering system components remain, the kinematic information is just changed. So there is no OPT_STEER_EXT parameter associated with it.
#
#Note that the steer import variable is for ONLY that part of the wheel steer caused by the steering system. Passive steer effects like ride toe and compliance should not be included.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

